<article class="info-card"><div class="number">01</div><h3>Submit and review</h3><p>Motions and petitions move through clearly identified review stages, with the next action visible to the right office.</p></article><article class="info-card"><div class="number">02</div><h3>Keep proceedings traceable</h3><p>Sittings, attendance, committee activity and recorded votes stay linked to their authorized records.</p></article><article class="info-card"><div class="number">03</div><h3>Publish with care</h3><p>The public portal displays records approved for public access and accepts petitions without an account.</p></article></div><p class="fineprint">e-Bunge supports organized workflows and records. It does not replace the Constitution, applicable legislation or the relevant County Assembly Standing Orders.</p></section></div></div>';
    render_end();exit;
